checkPD -- returns positive definite matrices from a list of symmetric  matrices
********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        checkPD(L)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of symmetric matrices, or a
        single symmetric *note Matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note ZeroTolerance: checkPD_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmZeroTolerance=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
        => ..., default value 1e-10, optional input to set the largest absolute
        value that should be treated as zero
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of positive definite matrices

Description
===========

This function takes a list of symmetric matrices (or a single symmetric matrix)
and returns the sublist of its positive definite matrices. If there are no
positive definite matrices in the list, it returns an empty list.

Note that the function does not check whether the matrices in the original list
are symmetric.

If a matrix contains an imaginary part below the tolerance level, then only the
real part is reported in the output. (See  *note
checkPD(...,ZeroTolerance=>...):
checkPD_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmZeroTolerance=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,)



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L={matrix{{1,0},{0,1}},matrix{{-2,0},{0,1}},matrix{{sqrt(-1),0},{0,sqrt |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = {| 1 0 |, | -2 0 |, | ii 0  |}                                          |
|      | 0 1 |  | 0  1 |  | 0  ii |                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : List                                                                    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|(-1)}}}                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : checkPD(L)                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {| 1 0 |}                                                               |
|      | 0 1 |                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

