jacobianMatrixOfRationalFunction -- Jacobian matrix of a rational function
**************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        jacobianMatrixOfRationalFunction(F)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, in *note frac:
        (Macaulay2Doc)frac,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the Jacobian matrix of a
        rational function

Description
===========

This function computes the Jacobian matrix of a rational function. The input is
an element in a fraction field.

+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x,y];                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : FR=frac R;                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : F=1/(x^2+y^2);                     |
+----------------------------------------+
|i4 : jacobianMatrixOfRationalFunction(F)|
|                                        |
|o4 = {5} | -2x/(x4+2x2y2+y4) |          |
|     {5} | -2y/(x4+2x2y2+y4) |          |
|                                        |
|              2       1                 |
|o4 : Matrix FR  <-- FR                  |
+----------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : R=QQ[t_1,t_2,t_3];                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : FR=frac R;                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : jacobianMatrixOfRationalFunction( (t_1^2*t_2)/(t_1+t_2^2+t_3^3) )       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = {4} | (2t_1t_2t_3^3+2t_1t_2^3+t_1^2t_2)/(t_3^6+2t_2^2t_3^3+t_2^4+2t_1t_ |
|     {4} | (t_1^2t_3^3-t_1^2t_2^2+t_1^3)/(t_3^6+2t_2^2t_3^3+t_2^4+2t_1t_3^3+ |
|     {4} | -3t_1^2t_2t_3^2/(t_3^6+2t_2^2t_3^3+t_2^4+2t_1t_3^3+2t_1t_2^2+t_1^ |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     3^3+2t_1t_2^2+t_1^2) |                                                  |
|     2t_1t_2^2+t_1^2)     |                                                  |
|     2)                   |                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|              3       1                                                      |
|o7 : Matrix FR  <-- FR                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

