|                  1,2   1,3   2,3   3,4   1,1   2,2   3,3   4,4   3,4        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : dim JnoSat                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 3                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : degree JnoSat                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : J=scoreEquations(R,U)                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = ideal (192199680p    - 99333449, 267221621760p    - 849243924773,       |
|                      3,4                          4,4                       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     1353974896462794079472640p    - 142165262245288892244817, 6898968p    - |
|                               3,3                                     2,2   |
