solverMLE(...,Solver=>...) -- choose numerical solver
*****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        solverMLE(G,U,Solver=>P)
  * Inputs:
      * P, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, name of the corresponding
        package

Description
===========

This option allows to choose which numerical solver to use to estimate the
critical points. There are two options: "EigenSolver" or "NAG4M2" (Numerical
Algebraic Geometry for Macaulay2).

The default and strongly recommended option is "EigenSolver", in which case the
function *note zeroDimSolve: (EigenSolver)zeroDimSolve, is used. If "NAG4M2" is
chosen, then *note solveSystem:
(NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)solveSystem_lpList_rp, is used.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G=mixedGraph(graph{{a,b}},digraph{{a,d}},bigraph{{c,d}})         |
|                                                                      |
|o1 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{c => {d}}}                         |
|                                   d => {c}                           |
|                Digraph => Digraph{a => {d}}                          |
|                                   d => {}                            |
|                Graph => Graph{a => {b}}                              |
|                               b => {a}                               |
|                                                                      |
|o1 : MixedGraph                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : U=matrix{{1, 2, 5, 1}, {5, 3, 2, 1}, {4, 3, 5, 10}, {2, 5,1, 3}};|
|                                                                      |
|              4       4                                               |
|o2 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                                |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : solverMLE (G,U,Solver=>"EigenSolver")                            |
|                                                                      |
|o3 = (-8.4691, | 2.5     0      0       2.26215 |, 1)                 |
|               | 0       1.1875 0       0       |                     |
|               | 0       0      3.1875  3.26493 |                     |
|               | 2.26215 0      3.26493 14.6143 |                     |
|                                                                      |
|o3 : Sequence                                                         |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : solverMLE (G,U,Solver=>"NAG4M2")                                 |
|                                                                      |
|o4 = (-8.4691, | 2.5     0      0       2.26215 |, 1)                 |
|               | 0       1.1875 0       0       |                     |
|               | 0       0      3.1875  3.26493 |                     |
|               | 2.26215 0      3.26493 14.6143 |                     |
|                                                                      |
|o4 : Sequence                                                         |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+

